{"steam_appid":2689120,"steam_name":"Gladio Mori","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2689120/630734766/4ed549445cfcfb2355e5ebd94bd49861da001e8e/1777373634/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777374169","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257323544/88894a4396aaa045cfead81b9d5601855b79732a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777374169","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/63e069d5f50f2b7ae0199dd19789b6ed3bb6decf/ss_63e069d5f50f2b7ae0199dd19789b6ed3bb6decf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785238338","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/04a660de519a4436b640a6ea4c8b06ef1cdca16a/ss_04a660de519a4436b640a6ea4c8b06ef1cdca16a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785238338","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/fb58c9ac6a3645846cb0281eb5d182d2049bc373/ss_fb58c9ac6a3645846cb0281eb5d182d2049bc373.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785238338","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/a08e31a4de3df55f12e05d20907992e37d146db5/ss_a08e31a4de3df55f12e05d20907992e37d146db5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785238338","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/fc28b62e4ad405f900934116938a4ed0652ea2cb/ss_fc28b62e4ad405f900934116938a4ed0652ea2cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785238338"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladio Mori is a physics-driven fighting game that redefines the gladiator arena. Whether playing solo or challenging others in multiplayer battles, you’ll wield razor-sharp weapons and unleash unique moves in brutal, tactical combat. Every decision, swing, and step matters as you carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.poster.avif?t=1785238338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/867483f80b4fcb1c6b5d8faa34dc98f5.webm?t=1785238338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on opponents in intense online battles with up to 4 players or enjoy the action locally with split-screen gameplay. Prove your skill and adaptability in every fight as you rise to claim victory in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/9c260f04c2f46bb2239e5fd40c1e1091.webp?t=1785238338\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Organ-Based Damage System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health bars—combat in Gladio Mori is as brutal as it is precise. Damage to muscles, arteries, and vitals directly impacts your ability to fight:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Injured Muscles</strong> weaken your strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severed Arteries</strong> cause you to bleed out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pierced Vitals</strong> mean instant death.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision and strategy are your greatest weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.poster.avif?t=1785238338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/b5e97daf375354b98fc10d9e52d8826e.webm?t=1785238338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Authentic Weapons and Armor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No magical gear here—just realistic weapons and armor that behave as they should. Plate armor blocks strikes, but exposes weak points. Find openings in your opponent’s defenses or risk being outmatched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.poster.avif?t=1785238338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/54085257f4078740f36eef3d59799664.webm?t=1785238338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In-Game Move Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a fully customizable move editor. Control your character’s physical body to craft unique animations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design efficient and devastating attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recreate iconic moves from your favorite films or games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with wild, unpredictable maneuvers—it's up to you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.poster.avif?t=1785238338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/e759da8944b2aad7c466a41c3bf69108.webm?t=1785238338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Community-Created Moves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an animator? No problem. Explore movesets shared by other players or mix and match individual moves to create a style that’s entirely yours. The community fuels the creativity in Gladio Mori.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.poster.avif?t=1785238338\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689120/extras/fc62e9e8efbf261ca7eec65da9e0eef5.webm?t=1785238338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Arena</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle in Gladio Mori is a test of strategy, skill, and ingenuity. Forge your fighting style, exploit weaknesses, and prove your worth in the ultimate arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gladiator's path awaits—are you ready?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Plebeian Studio"],"publishers":["Bonus Stage Publishing","Korgi Digital (China)"],"release_date":"26 Nov, 2024"}